cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "DICOM RT DVH Validation: an intermediate data layer for dose-volume parameter extraction"
abstract: >-
  Validation software for the use of DICOM RT DVH files at 1 cGy resolution as
  an intermediate caching layer between DICOM-RT source data held in a PACS and
  downstream clinical data repositories. Contains the DVH computation and
  caching modules, the dose-volume parameter extraction code, the six-phase
  experiment runner and the unit test suite used to validate the cache against
  analytical phantoms, published reference values and treatment planning system
  data.
type: software
